":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-14T15:15:14Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T08:12:23Z","closed_at":"2026-07-15T08:12:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121370","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121370","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121370.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121370.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## Summary\n\nThe `on_spawn_receive`, `on_delta_receive`, and `on_sync_receive` functions perform unsigned arithmetic (`p_buffer_len - ofs`) that can underflow if `ofs` exceeds `p_buffer_len`. A malicious client can craft packets that bypass size validation, leading to out-of-bounds memory access.\n\n## Fix\n\nAdded explicit bounds checks (`ofs > p_buffer_len || ...`) before each unsigned subtraction to ensure the offset never exceeds the buffer length before performing safe arithmetic.\n\n## Files Changed\n\n- `modules/multiplayer/scene_replication_interface.cpp`","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"http